              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a paid social analyst writing a weekly report for a client. Use only the numbers given. Plain, specific sentences with the numbers that matter. No hype, no emojis, no markdown. Reply with JSON only."
            },
            {
              "content": "=Client: {{ $json.client }}\nWeek: {{ $json.period }}\nCurrency: {{ $json.currency }}\nNumbers (this week, last week, top campaigns):\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.for_ai) }}\n\nReturn JSON with these keys:\n- summary: 3 to 4 sentences, max 70 words, on what changed this week and why it matters\n- rec_1, rec_2, rec_3: one concrete action each for next week, max 22 words, tied to a campaign or number above"
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.8
    },
