    {
      "id": "2032d4c7-65e7-4035-b5bd-29601d446d8c",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -520,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 460,
        "height": 1080,
        "content": "## Send weekly Facebook Ads client reports as PDFs\n\nFor agencies and freelancers who report on Facebook and Instagram ads every week and want the report written, designed and sent without opening Ads Manager.\n\n### How it works\n1. Every Monday the client list is read from Google Sheets.\n2. The Meta Ads API returns last week's numbers by campaign and the week before for comparison.\n3. A Code step works out spend, results, cost per result, CTR, ROAS and the change from last week.\n4. OpenAI writes a short summary and three actions for next week.\n5. Orshot renders a branded 2-page PDF report and Gmail sends it to the client.\n6. Every report is logged in Google Sheets, including skipped and failed ones.\n\n### Setup\n1. Get an Orshot API key at https://orshot.com (the free plan includes 100 credits a month).\n2. Add the report template (https://orshot.com/templates/2469) to your workspace and pick it in **Render report PDF**.\n3. Create a Meta access token with `ads_read` and add it as a Facebook Graph API credential.\n4. Make a sheet with a Clients tab (Client name, Ad account ID, Email, Currency, Result type, Active) and a Reports tab, then pick them in the Sheets steps.\n5. Set your agency name and footer in **Build report data**."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "1e33ce99-f8e2-4635-880e-f007979ddc71",
      "name": "Clients",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -40,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 600,
        "height": 1080,
        "content": "## 1. Read the client list\nRuns every Monday at 8am. Only rows with Active set to yes get a report."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "2dd52a7e-97c3-4ea9-856f-948d36a6f5ca",
      "name": "Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        580,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1000,
        "height": 1080,
        "content": "## 2. Pull and compare ads data\nLast 7 days by campaign and the 7 days before. Clients with no spend or a Meta API error are logged and skipped."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "0cc5d849-a1c4-4216-9ce2-6d53085234ff",
      "name": "Report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1600,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 980,
        "height": 1080,
        "content": "## 3. Write and render the report\nOpenAI writes the summary and next steps from the numbers. Orshot fills the 2-page PDF template. A failed render is logged with the reason."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b6a19fdb-17d6-407d-9b1f-fb163c9b5149",
      "name": "Send",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2600,
